@startuml Observer Pattern - Waitlist Notification Sequence

!theme plain

participant "ReservationService" as RS
participant "RoomAvailabilityPublisher" as Publisher
participant "WaitlistSubscriber" as Subscriber
participant "WaitlistService" as WS
participant "Admin" as Admin

RS -> RS: checkoutReservation(reservationId)
RS -> RS: Free rooms (set status to AVAILABLE)

loop For each room
    RS -> Publisher: publishRoomAvailable(room)
    Publisher -> Publisher: Notify all observers
    
    loop For each observer
        Publisher -> Subscriber: update(message)
        Subscriber -> WS: notifyAvailableRoom(room)
        WS -> WS: Check waitlist for matching preferences
        WS -> WS: Create notification
        WS -> Admin: Display notification
    end
end

RS -> RS: Complete checkout
RS --> RS: Checkout successful

note right of Publisher
    Observer Pattern:
    - Decouples room availability
    from waitlist management
    - Easy to add new observers
    (e.g., email notifications)
end note

@enduml





